<title>UK: WGZ-Bank Ireland sets 500 mln mark FRN. [CORRECTED 09:51 GMT]</title>
<headline>WGZ-Bank Ireland sets 500 mln mark FRN. [CORRECTED 09:51 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate</p>
<p>issue was announced by lead manager Lehman Brothers Bankhaus.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WGZ-BANK IRELAND PLC</p>
<p> KEEPWELL AGREEMENT BY WGZ-BANK (RATED A1)</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    25.APR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +1/16     PAY DATE    25.APR.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   0.20</p>
<p>(Corrects maturity to April 25, 2002 from August 25, 2002)</p>
<p> LISTING    DUES	DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.10	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
